      "kind": "tool",
      "name": "find_dsh_plugin",
      "description": "Search GitHub for DeepSeek Harness plugins (public `dsh-plugin` topic), ranked by stars. Returns descriptions and ready-to-run `dsh plugin add` install commands. Use when the user wants a capability DSH does not currently have, or asks what plugins exist. Plugins are third-party code — advise reviewing the source and pinning a commit. Falls back to keyword matches from the curated awesome-dsh-plugin list when GitHub search is rate limited or unreachable; the note states which source was used.",
